body:
Yes, I think it would behave kind of like contentEditable and autocomplete in that respect:
```js
element.contentEditable = true;
element.contentEditable; // "true"
element.contentEditable = "plaintext-only";
element.contentEditable; // "plaintext-only"
element.writingSuggestions = true;
element.writingSuggestions; // "true"
element.writingSuggestions = "some-valid-value";
element.writingSuggestions; // "some-valid-value"
```
